    {
      "id": "claim_c61f4e519a1e45898809cd5b19c2ade0",
      "statement": "The two sync workflows (wiki-publish.yml and wiki-import.yml) use three independent loop-prevention guards: a shared concurrency: wiki-sync group with cancel-in-progress: false (so the two directions never run at once and race on the same wiki), a [wiki-sync] commit-message guard on publish (wiki-publish.yml skips when the triggering commit message contains [wiki-sync]), and a github-actions[bot] sender guard on import (wiki-import.yml skips when the sender is github-actions[bot], i.e. the publish workflow itself).",
